        "paragraph_z3F74p": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_size": "md",
            "paragraph_width": "full",
            "text_color": "primary",
            "content": "<p>Opening originally as a small locksmith shop in Arleta, CA in 1978, Dean Safe has grown tremendously within the past 40 years. Dean Safe San Fernando showroom location opened in October of 2016 in North Hollywood, California.</p><p>Dean Safe North Hollywood features a large selection of safes including gun safes, home and office safes, high security safes, fire and burglary safes, handgun safes, wall safes, floor safes, drop safes & more. Dean Safe Company offers only the best selection of brand name safes & vaults in the industry, including brands like, American Security Safes (AMSEC), For Knox Vaults, Liberty Safes, Rhino, Stealth, Hollon, etc.</p><p>When it comes to protecting your valuable possessions, Dean Safe is the name you can trust. Our safes are designed with the highest level of security in mind, ensuring that your belongings are safe from theft, fire, and other potential risks.</p><p>All our experts at Dean Safe will fit you with the perfect safe for your needs. Dean Safe Company has a team of professional safe movers that offer local in-home delivery and installation. Come meet Josh and Moses in Dean Safe North Hollywood today!</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
